1
00:00:05,839 --> 00:00:06,999
Okay.
好

2
00:00:08,140 --> 00:00:11,940
I'm moving out, so you're in charge of paying the rent.
我要搬過去，房租就給你繳了

3
00:00:12,810 --> 00:00:14,330
-When's it due? -On the first.
也對，什麼時候要繳？ 1號 

4
00:00:14,640 --> 00:00:16,010
And that's every month?
每個月嗎？

5
00:00:16,780 --> 00:00:18,970
No, just the months you want to live here.
不是，你想住的月分才要繳

6
00:00:20,550 --> 00:00:22,520
Okay, here's the phone bill.
這是電話費

7
00:00:23,720 --> 00:00:25,280
Oh, my God!
天哪

8
00:00:26,520 --> 00:00:28,350
That's our phone number.
那是電話號碼

9
00:00:29,820 --> 00:00:33,020
I know I kind of sprung this me-moving-out-on-you thing.
是我突然決定要搬走的 

10
00:00:33,330 --> 00:00:36,820
-Why don't I cover you for a while? -No way!
所以我先幫你擋一陣子吧 不行 

11
00:00:37,070 --> 00:00:40,230
Joey Tribbiani does not take charity...
喬伊崔比亞尼不接受施捨…

12
00:00:40,970 --> 00:00:42,160
anymore.
再也不了

13
00:00:42,740 --> 00:00:45,970
-It's not charity, Joe. -Forget it.
這不是施捨… 不行，別再說了

14
00:00:46,170 --> 00:00:48,400
Thanks, but I'm done taking money from you.
謝謝，但我不想再拿你的錢了

15
00:00:48,640 --> 00:00:51,700
I can take care of myself. What's next? Come on.
我可以照顧自己，還有什麼？

16
00:00:52,010 --> 00:00:53,410
Here's the electric bill.
這是電費

17
00:00:53,680 --> 00:00:57,240
-This is how much we pay for electric? -Well,yeah.
用個電要這麼多錢？ 對

18
00:01:01,060 --> 00:01:03,890
So we'll do the rest of the bills later,then?
其他的帳單待會再看羅？

19
00:01:04,990 --> 00:01:06,820
The One On The Last Night
本集播出：「最後一夜」

00:01:07,990 --> 00:01:08,820
rainystar壓制iPod-MP4

20
00:01:42,330 --> 00:01:44,660
Will Joey have to give up the apartment?
那喬伊得搬出去嗎？

21
00:01:44,930 --> 00:01:47,160
I offered him money, but he wouldn't take it.
希望不用 我想給他錢，但是他不收

22
00:01:47,440 --> 00:01:48,830
How much does he need?
你覺得他需要多少？

23
00:01:49,070 --> 00:01:51,560
$1500 would cover him for a few months...
我想1千5應該夠他活幾個月

24
00:01:51,770 --> 00:01:55,570
but I have to trick him into taking it so I don't hurt his pride.
但我得騙他收下 免得傷害他的自尊

25
00:01:55,780 --> 00:01:57,800
Why don't you hire him as an actor?
你怎麼不雇他當演員？

26
00:01:59,010 --> 00:02:03,110
You could have him dress up and put on skits whenever you want.
你可以叫他扮裝演短劇 怎樣都行

27
00:02:05,020 --> 00:02:07,610
Well, that would help the pride thing.
那樣對自尊確實有幫助

28
00:02:10,190 --> 00:02:14,090
Wow, you look great! Do you wanna move in with me tomorrow?
你真是水噹噹 明天要不要搬來跟我住？

29
00:02:14,601 --> 00:02:15,932
好啊 好

30
00:02:17,430 --> 00:02:18,920
Any plans for tonight?
你們女生今晚要做什麼？

31
00:02:19,170 --> 00:02:21,660
Instead of being sad on my last night with Rachel...
與其難過我和瑞秋要分開 

32
00:02:21,870 --> 00:02:25,830
we're going out to celebrate Rachel's moving in with Phoebe.
我們不如去吃飯慶祝 瑞秋搬去跟菲比住

34
00:02:26,110 --> 00:02:29,270
-And also my birthday. -It's not your birthday.
還有我的生日 今天不是你的生日

35
00:02:29,880 --> 00:02:34,780
What a mean thing to say! I'd never tell you it wasn't your birthday.
這樣講好惡劣 我就不會戳破你

36
00:02:37,720 --> 00:02:40,620
You guys have anything planned for the big last night?
你們男生有什麼節目嗎？

37
00:02:40,890 --> 00:02:44,620
Instead of just hanging out, we figure we'd do nothing.
與其一起打混 我們決定什麼也不做

38
00:02:46,390 --> 00:02:50,830
Knicks' season opener tonight. I thought you'd come and watch it.
今晚是尼克隊首戰 我以為你們會想來我家看

40
00:02:51,030 --> 00:02:52,360
I don't know,Ross.
不知道耶

41
00:02:52,630 --> 00:02:56,500
Not if you talk about how you gave up basketball to become a paleontologist.
我怕你又吹說你放棄打球 去當古生物學家

42
00:02:56,740 --> 00:03:01,300
I did give up a career in basketball to become a paleontologist!
我本來就放棄打球 去當古生物學家

43
00:03:02,140 --> 00:03:04,300
-Phoebe.. -You're not dressed yet?
菲比，我在想… 你還沒換衣服？

44
00:03:04,550 --> 00:03:07,240
We're supposed to start having fun in 15 minutes!
我們15分鐘後就要去玩了

45
00:03:08,250 --> 00:03:11,240
And clearly, not a minute sooner.
而且早1分鐘都不行

46
00:03:11,990 --> 00:03:15,650
You are packed,though, right? Please tell me you're packed?
你都打包好了吧？拜託你說是

47
00:03:15,890 --> 00:03:19,090
Of course I'm packed. Monica,relax.
我當然打包好了，你別緊張

48
00:03:19,330 --> 00:03:21,690
I wanted to ask Phoebe what I should wear.
我只是想問菲比我該穿什麼

49
00:03:21,930 --> 00:03:24,490
My God,I can't get a minute of peace.
天哪，我真是一刻也不得閒

50
00:03:28,270 --> 00:03:30,100
Oh,my God!
我的天哪

51
00:03:32,110 --> 00:03:34,400
Monica's just gonna kill you.
摩妮卡會宰了你

52
00:03:34,680 --> 00:03:35,840
I know.
我知道 

53
00:03:36,040 --> 00:03:38,100
What you're wearing is fine for that.
你穿這樣蠻適合慘死的

54
00:03:39,919 --> 00:03:41,546
瑞秋，我要借…

55
00:03:42,580 --> 00:03:44,110
You're not packed!
你沒打包！

56
00:03:44,620 --> 00:03:47,090
You're not packed even a little bit!
你根本沒打包

57
00:03:48,260 --> 00:03:49,520
Surprise!
驚喜

58
00:03:51,590 --> 00:03:53,790
Don't get mad, because this is what happened.
什麼？ 你別發飆，是這樣的

59
00:03:54,100 --> 00:03:57,530
I started packing, then I realized,"What am I doing?"
我開始打包 然後想到：我在幹嘛？ 

61
00:03:57,730 --> 00:04:00,460
I am lousy at packing,right?
我最不會打包了，對吧？

62
00:04:00,970 --> 00:04:02,440
But you love packing!
但你最愛打包了 

63
00:04:02,700 --> 00:04:06,610
So as a gift to you on our last night....
所以做為我的臨別贈禮…

64
00:04:11,480 --> 00:04:13,210
I'll be coordinator!
我可以當總指揮

65
00:04:13,450 --> 00:04:16,820
Oh, my God, I'm so sorry. I didn't get you anything.
對不起，我沒幫你準備禮物

66
00:04:17,290 --> 00:04:19,810
Everybody has to help. Phoebe, can you help?
大家都要幫忙 菲比你可以幫忙吧？

67
00:04:20,090 --> 00:04:21,390
I have plans.
我有事

68
00:04:21,920 --> 00:04:24,290
-You have plans with us. -That's right.
你是跟我們有約 沒錯

69
00:04:25,930 --> 00:04:28,730
Chandler can make boxes, Ross can wrap and Joey can lift.
錢德可以帖紙箱，羅斯封箱 喬伊搬東西

70
00:04:29,000 --> 00:04:31,090
Tell the guys they have to help out.
菲比，去通知男生幫忙 好

71
00:04:31,330 --> 00:04:33,130
My God,thank you!
天哪，謝謝你

72
00:04:34,470 --> 00:04:36,960
Monica's gonna make you pack! She's got jobs for everyone!
快逃，摩妮卡要叫你們收東西 她把工作都分好了

73
00:04:37,240 --> 00:04:40,570
Now, it's too late for me, but save yourselves!
我是躲不掉了，你們快逃

74
00:04:42,910 --> 00:04:46,110
The movers will be here in 11 hours. Rachel hasn't packed.
搬家公司11個小時後會來 瑞秋還沒打包

75
00:04:46,350 --> 00:04:48,320
Now, everybody has to help. Chandler..
每個人都得幫忙 錢德

76
00:04:48,580 --> 00:04:50,450
I have plans with Joey.
我和喬伊有事

77
00:04:51,250 --> 00:04:55,310
-You said you were doing nothing. -Yes,but for the last time.
你不是說你們沒事？ 這是最後一次了嘛

78
00:04:57,090 --> 00:04:58,460
Fine. Now,Ross..
好吧，羅斯…

79
00:04:58,690 --> 00:05:01,090
-I can't do it. -Why not?
我沒辦法幫忙 為什麼？

80
00:05:01,330 --> 00:05:04,790
-Don't you have Ben? -Because I have Ben!
班要來 因為班要來

81
00:05:05,830 --> 00:05:08,430
It's almost past his bedtime. Where is he?
都快8點了，他都快上床了 他在哪裡？

82
00:05:08,640 --> 00:05:10,040
He's at a dinner party.
他去參加晚宴

83
00:05:12,510 --> 00:05:15,170
He's really coming? I can see in your apartment.
他真的要來？我看得見你家喔

84
00:05:15,440 --> 00:05:17,640
Of course he is. What?
當然是真的

85
00:05:17,880 --> 00:05:20,440
You think I'd use my son as an excuse?
難道我會拿兒子當藉口？ 

86
00:05:20,650 --> 00:05:23,010
What kind of father do you think I am?
你把我當成哪種爸爸？

87
00:05:23,690 --> 00:05:24,780
All right. Sorry.
好吧，對不起

88
00:05:25,990 --> 00:05:27,980
I gotta go make a fake Ben.
我得做個班的人偶

89
00:05:32,630 --> 00:05:33,620
Here it is.
來了

90
00:05:33,830 --> 00:05:36,350
Our last pizzas together as roommates.
室友時代最後的披薩

91
00:05:36,560 --> 00:05:39,000
I wish I knew that. I ordered Chinese.
我不知道你會買披薩 我叫了中國菜

92
00:05:39,230 --> 00:05:40,890
Well,that's okay.
沒關係

93
00:05:41,140 --> 00:05:43,500
In a way it's kind of nice. You know?
其實這樣蠻好的 

94
00:05:43,740 --> 00:05:47,700
Our last dinner together. Me, bringing the food of my ancestors...
我們最後的兩人晚餐 我帶我祖先的食物 

96
00:05:47,980 --> 00:05:50,140
you,the food of yours!
你帶你祖先的食物

97
00:05:54,880 --> 00:05:57,540
I had an idea for what to do on our last night.
喬伊，我有個比較奇怪的想法

98
00:05:57,750 --> 00:06:00,690
What do you say we play a little foosball for money?
我們來打幾盤賭錢如何？

99
00:06:00,920 --> 00:06:04,920
Are you crazy? You haven't beaten me since my injury-plagued '97 season.
你瘋啦？自97年傷後復出 你就沒贏過我

100
00:06:05,190 --> 00:06:08,890
-It'd be easier to give me your money. -Yes, it would.
你拿錢送我還比較快 是啊

101
00:06:10,500 --> 00:06:11,990
What do you say to $50?
你覺得50元如何？

102
00:06:12,600 --> 00:06:17,400
I say to it: "50 dollars,you are more than I have."
我會對它說 50元，你比我的財產還多

103
00:06:18,070 --> 00:06:20,730
If you know that you'll win, what difference does it make?
既然知道會贏，為什麼不賭？

104
00:06:20,910 --> 00:06:23,000
-You're on. -Okay,let's play.
好，賭了 好，開賽

105
00:06:23,210 --> 00:06:25,110
The big game. Italy versus...
世紀之戰，意大利對… 

106
00:06:25,380 --> 00:06:26,900
China, apparently.
當然是中國隊

108
00:06:30,950 --> 00:06:33,180
Look,it's the Rollerblades.
看，是直排輪鞋 

109
00:06:33,420 --> 00:06:34,890
Oh,God!
天哪

110
00:06:35,420 --> 00:06:38,260
You remember when we got these?
記得我們什麼時候買的嗎？

111
00:06:38,898 --> 00:06:40,058
不記得

112
00:06:41,360 --> 00:06:42,920
I guess you weren't there.
那你應該不在

113
00:06:44,700 --> 00:06:47,530
You guys, we said we were gonna have fun.
喂，我們說過要開心的

114
00:06:47,800 --> 00:06:50,570
Come on. Hey, remember the time....
別這樣，記不記得那次…

115
00:06:55,880 --> 00:06:57,370
You don't remember?
你們不記得嗎？

116
00:06:58,450 --> 00:07:01,810
Sorry,Phoebe. I'm just really sad that I'm leaving.
對不起，要搬走我真的很難過

117
00:07:02,080 --> 00:07:03,910
I'm gonna miss you so much.
我會很想你

118
00:07:04,150 --> 00:07:07,420
This doesn't have to be so sad, though,you know?
其實不必這麼難過

119
00:07:07,660 --> 00:07:10,750
Instead of thinking about how you'll miss each other...
別再想你們會想念對方了 

120
00:07:10,960 --> 00:07:14,720
you should think of the things you're not gonna miss.
想想你們不會懷念的事

121
00:07:15,660 --> 00:07:17,430
I don't think there's anything.
我覺得沒有 

122
00:07:17,630 --> 00:07:19,900
Come on,there's gotta be something.
總會有一兩件

123
00:07:21,270 --> 00:07:23,070
She's perfect.
沒有，她太完美了

124
00:07:26,310 --> 00:07:27,500
I have one.
我有一件

125
00:07:29,510 --> 00:07:31,100
Okay, you can go first.
很好，你先說

126
00:07:31,350 --> 00:07:33,640
I guess I'm not gonna miss the fact...
我不會想念 

127
00:07:33,920 --> 00:07:37,940
that you're never allowed to move the phone pen.
你不准我把留言筆拿走

128
00:07:41,590 --> 00:07:44,110
That's a good one. Okay, Monica, anything?
說得好，摩妮卡，你有嗎？ 

129
00:07:44,360 --> 00:07:46,620
You know, does Rachel move the phone pen?
瑞秋會把留言筆拿走嗎？

130
00:07:47,860 --> 00:07:49,420
Sometimes.
有時候會

131
00:07:50,670 --> 00:07:52,030
Always, actually.
其實每次都會

132
00:07:53,970 --> 00:07:56,270
There you go. Doesn't everyone feel better?
這就對了，這樣不是好多了？

133
00:07:57,870 --> 00:07:59,810
Not just the phone pen.
不只是留言筆

134
00:08:01,440 --> 00:08:03,100
I never get my messages.
我老是收不到留言 

135
00:08:03,310 --> 00:08:04,870
You get your messages.
你收到啦

136
00:08:05,180 --> 00:08:08,270
It doesn't count if you have to read them off your hand...
趁你在沙發上睡著 

137
00:08:08,520 --> 00:08:11,380
after you've fallen asleep on the couch.
去看你的手背應該不算

138
00:08:11,620 --> 00:08:14,180
So you missed a message from who? Chandler?
那你是沒接到誰的留言？ 錢德？

139
00:08:14,490 --> 00:08:15,850
Or your mom?
還是你媽？

140
00:08:16,660 --> 00:08:18,020
Or Chandler?
還是錢德？

141
00:08:18,230 --> 00:08:19,390
Or your mom?
還是你媽？

142
00:08:23,460 --> 00:08:25,230
It worked! No one's sad!
太好了，成功了，沒人難過了

143
00:08:29,400 --> 00:08:30,390
I win again!
萬歲！我又贏了 

144
00:08:30,670 --> 00:08:33,570
That's,like, 500 bucks you owe me!
你已經欠我5百了

145
00:08:33,840 --> 00:08:36,170
Man! Five hundred dollars.
5百美金

146
00:08:36,480 --> 00:08:39,640
That is a lot of electricity,huh?
值很多電

147
00:08:40,650 --> 00:08:42,380
I gotta buy some food.
我得買點吃的

148
00:08:43,220 --> 00:08:46,080
Give me a chance to win my money back. Sudden death...
給我撈本的機會 驟死賽

149
00:08:46,390 --> 00:08:49,050
one goal,$1000.
一球…1千

150
00:08:49,660 --> 00:08:51,150
-You serious? -Yes!
真的？ 當然

151
00:08:52,930 --> 00:08:54,690
Get ready to owe me.
好，準備欠我錢吧 好

152
00:08:54,930 --> 00:08:56,230
Here we go. Ready?
來吧，好了嗎？

154
00:09:23,060 --> 00:09:24,050
No...
不~~

155
00:09:24,230 --> 00:09:25,450
one can beat me!
要想贏我

156
00:09:30,060 --> 00:09:33,900
That's why only the little fake men are supposed to do the kicking.
看吧，所以只有小假人 可以出腳

157
00:09:40,110 --> 00:09:42,970
Hi, Ross. See, other people call me!
羅斯…看吧，還有別人會打來

158
00:09:43,240 --> 00:09:45,910
Oh, your brother. Score!
你老哥，了不起

159
00:09:47,420 --> 00:09:48,750
What's up?
怎樣？

160
00:09:48,980 --> 00:09:50,210
I'm here with Ben.
我跟班在一起

161
00:09:50,480 --> 00:09:52,040
Thought we'd say hi.
想跟你問個好

162
00:09:52,290 --> 00:09:55,810
-Put him on. -Ben,say hi to Aunt Monica.
叫他聽 班，跟摩妮卡姑姑打招呼

164
00:09:57,730 --> 00:10:01,320
I guess he doesn't feel like talking right now.
看來他現在不想說話 

165
00:10:01,560 --> 00:10:04,050
He's smiling,though.
不過他在笑

166
00:10:04,670 --> 00:10:07,160
Okay, talk to you later.
好，待會再聊

167
00:10:14,080 --> 00:10:18,030
You know, Daddy was gonna be a basketball player.
爸爸本來要去打籃球的

168
00:10:24,120 --> 00:10:26,640
I think it was better when you guys were sad.
我覺得你們難過時比較好

169
00:10:27,990 --> 00:10:30,360
Hey, remember the Rollerblades?
記得這雙直排輪鞋嗎？

170
00:10:32,190 --> 00:10:34,660
You know what else I won't miss? "I'm Monica.
你知道我還不會想念什麼？ 我是摩妮卡 

171
00:10:34,900 --> 00:10:38,300
I wash the toilets 17 times a day, even if people are on it!"
我一天刷十七次馬桶 有人在上也照刷

173
00:10:39,530 --> 00:10:42,230
"Hi,I'm Rachel. Is my sweater too tight?
我是瑞秋 我的毛衣太緊了嗎？

174
00:10:42,500 --> 00:10:44,900
I'd better wash it and shrink it!"
不會？那我得洗一洗讓它縮水

175
00:10:45,810 --> 00:10:49,330
"I'm Monica. I never get messages from interesting people."
我是摩妮卡 都沒有有趣的人留言給我

176
00:10:49,540 --> 00:10:51,340
I call her.
我會打給她

177
00:10:52,250 --> 00:10:57,380
"Oh, my God! I love Ross. I hate Ross. I love Ross. I hate Ross!"
天哪！我愛羅斯，我恨羅斯 我愛羅斯，我恨羅斯

178
00:10:58,720 --> 00:11:00,480
"My God! I can't find a boyfriend.
天哪！我交不到男朋友

179
00:11:00,760 --> 00:11:04,890
I'll stumble across the hall and sleep with the first guy I find there!"
乾脆到對面去看到誰就上誰

180
00:11:07,130 --> 00:11:09,490
You guys, come on, this is the last night!
拜託啦，都最後一夜了

181
00:11:09,660 --> 00:11:13,430
Yeah,you're right, and so for the last time I would like to ask you:
你說得對 所以我再說最後一次

182
00:11:13,600 --> 00:11:16,000
Boo-hoo. Get out of my room!
滾出我的房間

183
00:11:21,640 --> 00:11:25,810
We should get a move on if we want to make those dinner reservations.
如果想趕去餐廳就得快了

184
00:11:33,820 --> 00:11:35,380
Still broken?
還是壞的？

185
00:11:36,090 --> 00:11:37,650
It sucks,man.
真是爛透了

186
00:11:37,930 --> 00:11:40,690
Your last night,and I lose the two most important things:
你在這裡的最後一晚 我卻失去兩樣最重要的東西

187
00:11:40,900 --> 00:11:43,060
The foosball table...
足球檯

188
00:11:43,360 --> 00:11:45,090
and $500.
和5百元

189
00:11:46,330 --> 00:11:50,060
There are other ways to win back your money. How about blackjack?
有別的辦法可以把錢贏回去 要不要玩二十一點？

190
00:11:50,340 --> 00:11:51,600
Not my game.
我不喜歡那個

191
00:11:51,910 --> 00:11:54,400
You know what? We can play a new game.
那就玩… 我們可以玩個新遊戲

192
00:11:54,710 --> 00:11:56,940
-It's fun! -What's it called?
很好玩 叫什麼名字？

194
00:11:58,410 --> 00:11:59,850
Cups.
杯牌

195
00:12:01,380 --> 00:12:04,840
-I don't know how. -I'll teach you. It's easy and fun.
我不會玩杯牌 我教你，來嘛，簡單又好玩

196
00:12:05,050 --> 00:12:06,920
-All right. -Here you go.
好吧 好，拿牌

197
00:12:08,460 --> 00:12:10,390
I have two queens. What do you have?
我有兩張皮蛋，你呢？

198
00:12:10,890 --> 00:12:13,120
-A 2 and a 5. -You win! Fifty dollars!
二和五 你贏了，50元

199
00:12:16,060 --> 00:12:17,860
-Really? -Let's play again.
真的？ 沒錯，再玩

200
00:12:21,640 --> 00:12:23,930
-What have you got? -4 and a 9.
你是什麼牌？ 四和九 

202
00:12:24,540 --> 00:12:26,060
You're kidding,right?
不會吧？

203
00:12:27,310 --> 00:12:29,710
-No. Why? -That's a full cup!
怎麼了？ 那是滿杯

204
00:12:31,750 --> 00:12:33,870
Damn, I am good at Cups!
我真是杯牌高手

205
00:12:36,280 --> 00:12:37,770
I'm not talking to her.
我不要跟她說話

206
00:12:38,090 --> 00:12:40,610
You have to take the first step...
總得有人先開口

207
00:12:40,890 --> 00:12:44,290
because she's the one who's leaving. It's harder for her.
這個人應該是你 因為她要搬走，她比較難過

208
00:12:45,660 --> 00:12:46,820
Maybe you're right.
也許吧…

209
00:12:47,090 --> 00:12:49,490
But she made fun of my phone pen!
但她嘲笑我的留言筆

210
00:12:50,330 --> 00:12:52,460
I know. I took it hard too.
我知道，我也覺得很過分

211
00:12:54,670 --> 00:12:58,160
She's in there right now, crying. I can hear her.
她正在裡面哭，我聽得見

212
00:13:00,440 --> 00:13:02,030
She's not crying.
她沒有在哭

213
00:13:02,210 --> 00:13:06,010
She's holding it in. She's so brave. Go.
她正在忍，真勇敢，快去吧

214
00:13:08,780 --> 00:13:11,120
I feel bad about what happened..
瑞秋，剛才的事我很… 

215
00:13:11,350 --> 00:13:13,840
-What are you doing? -I'm unpacking.
你在幹什麼？ 把東西拿出來 什麼？

217
00:13:15,290 --> 00:13:17,880
I'm not moving. Is that picture straight?
我不搬了，這幅畫正嗎？

218
00:13:18,160 --> 00:13:20,960
It needs to go about 20 blocks to the left.
離左邊差了十萬八千里

219
00:13:21,230 --> 00:13:25,160
You're the one who wants this big change and to move in with Chandler!
你知道嗎？ 是你要改變，跟錢德同居

220
00:13:25,400 --> 00:13:27,390
You should go! Why do I have to leave?
你才應該走，為什麼要我走？

221
00:13:27,670 --> 00:13:31,370
-It's my apartment! -It's mine too! What else you got?
因為這是我的房子 它也是我的，還有呢？

222
00:13:32,640 --> 00:13:34,230
How about: You're moving!
還有就是你要搬出去

223
00:13:45,050 --> 00:13:46,420
This is ridiculous.
這樣太可笑了

224
00:13:48,390 --> 00:13:50,150
We should be packing you!
我們應該幫你打包

225
00:13:51,990 --> 00:13:55,020
-Hey, how you guys doing? -Great. Monica's moving.
你們談得怎樣？ 很好，摩妮卡要搬走

226
00:13:56,530 --> 00:13:57,590
I am not!
我才沒有

227
00:13:57,900 --> 00:14:00,870
Really? How come all your stuff is in this box?
是嗎？那為什麼你的東西 都在這個箱子裡？

228
00:14:01,100 --> 00:14:04,700
Okay, you guys, I think I know what's going on here!
好，我知道是怎麼回事了

229
00:14:05,270 --> 00:14:07,170
You guys? Stop!
喂…停

230
00:14:07,940 --> 00:14:12,540
I know you're acting mad because it'll make it easier to leave.
你們是假裝生氣，以免捨不得

231
00:14:12,750 --> 00:14:15,840
But deep down,you're really sad. Deep,deep down.
其實內心深處你們還是很難過

232
00:14:16,080 --> 00:14:18,240
-No, Phoebe, I am mad! -Well,deep deep deep down!
不，我很生氣 最最最深處 

233
00:14:18,520 --> 00:14:19,710
I'm just mad.
我就是很生氣

234
00:14:20,750 --> 00:14:21,850
Then keep running.
那就繼續追吧

235
00:14:25,360 --> 00:14:26,350
You win!
你贏了

236
00:14:26,590 --> 00:14:28,620
-What did you have? -Nothing beats...
你是什麼牌？ 不重要 什麼都比不上...

237
00:14:29,260 --> 00:14:31,130
a three and a six.
三和六

238
00:14:31,900 --> 00:14:34,030
That, my friend, is "D Cup."
那叫D罩杯

239
00:14:36,200 --> 00:14:38,600
How much have you won so far?
你目前為止贏了多少？

240
00:14:40,040 --> 00:14:42,240
-700. -Not 700 exactly?
哇，7百 不是正好7百吧？

242
00:14:44,040 --> 00:14:45,740
Double it.
再加7百 

243
00:14:46,710 --> 00:14:50,380
In Cups, once you get $700, you have to double it.
在杯牌裡，一旦贏到7百 就得自動加碼

244
00:14:52,150 --> 00:14:54,120
I didn't make up the rules.
規則又不是我訂的

245
00:14:56,220 --> 00:15:00,130
Now, after you receive the doubling bonus, you get one card.
拿到加碼獎金後 你可以拿一張牌

246
00:15:00,390 --> 00:15:04,990
That one card could be worth $100, which brings your total to $1500.
那張牌有可能值1百元 讓你總共贏得1千5

247
00:15:06,500 --> 00:15:10,960
Don't get excited, that won't happen unless you get the.. No way!
別太興奮，除非你拿到… 不會吧

248
00:15:14,070 --> 00:15:16,130
This is the last box of your clothes.
這是最後一箱衣服

249
00:15:16,340 --> 00:15:19,340
I'm just gonna label it "What were you thinking?"
我會在上面註明 「你在想什麼？」

250
00:15:20,780 --> 00:15:24,340
I was just gonna go across the hall and write that on Chandler.
有意思，我正想到對面 在錢德身上那樣寫

251
00:15:27,020 --> 00:15:29,790
Guys, I don't wanna make things worse, but...
兩位，不是我想雪上加霜

252
00:15:30,020 --> 00:15:32,360
I don't wanna live with Rachel anymore.
但我不想跟瑞秋住了

253
00:15:32,660 --> 00:15:35,130
-What? -You're so mean to each other.
什麼？ 你們對對方好壞

254
00:15:35,330 --> 00:15:38,590
I don't wanna end up like that with Rachel. I still like you.
我不想跟瑞秋翻臉 我還是喜歡你

255
00:15:39,330 --> 00:15:42,100
That's fine because I'm not moving.
沒關係，因為我不搬了

256
00:15:43,440 --> 00:15:45,130
Phoebe, you gotta take her.
菲比，你一定要收留她

257
00:15:45,870 --> 00:15:47,530
I said some bad stuff...
我說了很多她的壞話 

258
00:15:47,780 --> 00:15:50,840
but Rachel has qualities that make her a good roommate.
但瑞秋也有一些好室友的特質

259
00:15:51,110 --> 00:15:52,510
Like what, Monica?
是嗎？像什麼？

260
00:15:55,680 --> 00:15:58,050
She has 147,000 pair of boots.
她有幾千雙靴子

261
00:15:58,320 --> 00:15:59,950
Good start,Mon.
真是個好的開始

262
00:16:01,120 --> 00:16:02,680
She lets you borrow them.
她會借給你穿

263
00:16:03,160 --> 00:16:06,060
And you stretch them out with your big old clown feet.
然後你再用你的大腳把它撐大

264
00:16:07,660 --> 00:16:10,390
Do you wanna live outside? Because it's getting cold!
你想睡路邊嗎？天氣要變冷羅

265
00:16:12,300 --> 00:16:17,170
She gets tons of catalogs and folds down the pages of things I'd like.
她有一大堆目錄 她會把我會喜歡的部分折起來

267
00:16:17,640 --> 00:16:18,630
What else?
還有呢？

268
00:16:20,310 --> 00:16:22,070
When I take a shower...
我洗澡時 

269
00:16:22,540 --> 00:16:24,570
she leaves me notes on the mirror.
她會在鏡子上留言給我

270
00:16:24,880 --> 00:16:27,040
I do. I do do that.
那倒是

271
00:16:27,410 --> 00:16:31,250
That's nice. I like having things to read in the bathroom.
真好 我喜歡浴室裡有東西可讀

272
00:16:33,550 --> 00:16:36,020
When I fall asleep on the couch...
我在沙發上看書看到睡著 

273
00:16:37,390 --> 00:16:39,190
she covers me with a blanket.
她會幫我蓋毯子

274
00:16:39,660 --> 00:16:43,260
Well,you know, I don't want you to be cold.
我不希望你冷到

276
00:16:46,770 --> 00:16:50,400
And when I told her I was gonna move in with Chandler...
當我說我要跟錢德同居時 

277
00:16:50,670 --> 00:16:52,430
she was really supportive.
她非常支持我

278
00:16:55,240 --> 00:16:56,900
You were so great.
你真好

279
00:16:58,350 --> 00:17:00,580
You made it so easy.
讓我無後顧之憂

280
00:17:02,450 --> 00:17:04,750
And now you have to leave.
現在你要走了 

281
00:17:05,250 --> 00:17:07,720
And I have to live with a boy!
我得跟一個男生住了

282
00:17:10,760 --> 00:17:12,780
It's gonna be fine.
不會有事的

283
00:17:13,790 --> 00:17:16,350
Now I can't wait to live with you!
瑞秋，我真希望你趕快搬進來

284
00:17:17,230 --> 00:17:18,360
You know what we should do?
而且我們應該

285
00:17:18,600 --> 00:17:22,560
Bring Monica, and we'll live together! We'll have so much fun!
把摩妮卡也帶來 我們一起住 一定會很好玩

286
00:17:24,300 --> 00:17:26,400
I think she's moving in with Chandler.
但是她要跟錢德住 

287
00:17:26,640 --> 00:17:29,800
Oh,that's right. You're still set on that?
也對 你還是要跟他住嗎？

289
00:17:31,380 --> 00:17:32,940
Kind of.
應該吧

290
00:17:39,050 --> 00:17:40,250
Oh,my God!
我的天哪

291
00:17:45,760 --> 00:17:47,660
How's the packing going?
摩妮卡，打包順利嗎？

292
00:17:48,260 --> 00:17:51,750
Ben? He's fine. He's right.. Oh, my God!
班？他很好，他就在…媽呀

293
00:17:53,270 --> 00:17:56,500
Get your head out of your shirt there, son!
把頭從衣服裡伸出來

294
00:17:58,470 --> 00:18:01,460
Yeah, it's a pumpkin. I'll come pack.
什麼？ 對，是南瓜，我過去幫忙

295
00:18:05,950 --> 00:18:08,410
-What's wrong?  -Ross and I were helping pack...
怎麼了？ 羅斯和我幫忙打包

297
00:18:08,620 --> 00:18:12,520
took a little break. I lost $1500 to him in Cups!
在休息時 我跟他玩杯牌輸了1千5

298
00:18:14,790 --> 00:18:16,810
How did you lose at Cups?
玩杯牌怎麼會輸？ 

299
00:18:17,360 --> 00:18:18,690
The same way you lost!
跟你輸的方式一樣

300
00:18:18,960 --> 00:18:23,420
I started out with the king and the queen. Bam! Ross gets a 2 and a 3.
我先拿到老K和皮蛋 砰！羅斯拿到2和3

301
00:18:24,000 --> 00:18:27,360
Then I get a jack and a king. Boom! Ross gets a 4 and 5.
然後我拿到傑克和老K 砰！羅斯拿到4和5

302
00:18:27,970 --> 00:18:30,770
Even Ross was getting the Cup card, the D Cup...
羅斯拿到滿杯，D罩杯 

303
00:18:31,040 --> 00:18:36,170
the sitting-down bonus. I didn't even get half a cup! Nothing!
和自動加碼 我連半副杯牌都湊不到

305
00:18:36,980 --> 00:18:38,100
Oh,man!
天哪

306
00:18:38,880 --> 00:18:40,870
He never played before either.
他之前也沒玩過 

307
00:18:41,150 --> 00:18:44,450
I think beginner's luck is very important in Cups!
我覺得玩杯牌都靠新手的牌運

308
00:18:45,790 --> 00:18:47,950
Let's play one more hand. One more hand.
好，我們再玩一把

309
00:18:48,160 --> 00:18:51,650
No more! I cannot lose another dime. I'm serious this time.
不要，我1毛錢也輸不起了 我是說真的

310
00:18:51,890 --> 00:18:53,360
In fact,look.
事實上

311
00:18:53,630 --> 00:18:55,390
I wanna give you something.
我要送你一樣東西

312
00:18:55,660 --> 00:18:58,460
Let me give it to you before I pawn it for Cups money.
現在先送 免得我為了賭債拿去當

314
00:19:02,240 --> 00:19:05,330
I want you to have the big,white dog...
我要把大白狗送給你

315
00:19:05,640 --> 00:19:09,340
as a thank-you for being such a great roommate.
謝謝你這些年來的照顧

316
00:19:09,580 --> 00:19:12,910
I can't take the big white dog. You love it.
我不能收，你很喜歡這個雕像

317
00:19:13,150 --> 00:19:15,580
It's "him." Not "it."
他不是雕像，他是活的

318
00:19:16,520 --> 00:19:19,110
What if I bought it from you?
要是我跟你買呢？

319
00:19:19,320 --> 00:19:22,550
Then your nice gesture would be giving it to me at a reasonable price.
你可以以合理的價格賣給我 

320
00:19:22,820 --> 00:19:24,520
Say $1500?
1千5如何？

321
00:19:26,390 --> 00:19:29,850
Wait a second. I see what you're trying to do here.
等一下，我知道你想幹嘛了

322
00:19:30,260 --> 00:19:32,430
You're trying to give me money again!
你又想塞錢給我

323
00:19:32,670 --> 00:19:34,570
When did I try to give you money?
我什麼時候塞錢給你了？ 

324
00:19:34,840 --> 00:19:36,600
Over there with the bills!
之前看帳單的時候

325
00:19:36,840 --> 00:19:39,830
You tried to give me charity, I said no, you dropped it.
你想施捨我 我說不要，你也就算了

326
00:19:40,070 --> 00:19:41,900
We had a nice last night together.
然後我們開心度過最後一晚

327
00:19:42,180 --> 00:19:45,700
We had some fun,we gambled,nobody tried to give anybody any money.
說笑，賭錢，誰也沒塞錢給誰

328
00:19:47,850 --> 00:19:50,680
Now you start with the charity thing again!
現在你突然又想來這套

329
00:19:50,920 --> 00:19:54,720
I'm trying to help you out. I wanna make sure that you're okay.
我只是想幫助你 我想確定你的生活沒問題

330
00:19:54,920 --> 00:19:56,950
I will be okay.
我會沒問題的

331
00:19:57,220 --> 00:20:01,130
You gotta get it out of your head that I can't take care of myself.
你不能老覺得我無法照顧自己

332
00:20:02,430 --> 00:20:05,520
I'm not gonna miss you helping me out with money.
我不會懷念你借錢給我

333
00:20:05,770 --> 00:20:08,060
The only thing I'm gonna miss...
我唯一會懷念的...

334
00:20:08,600 --> 00:20:10,070
is you.
就是你

335
00:20:12,810 --> 00:20:14,300
And now the dog.
現在還有這隻狗

336
00:20:23,480 --> 00:20:25,640
-Call me when you get there,okay? -Okay.
到了打電話給我，好嗎？ 好

337
00:20:25,920 --> 00:20:27,550
I'm really gonna miss you.
我真的會很想你

338
00:20:34,800 --> 00:20:36,630
I have your key.
鑰匙要還你

339
00:20:37,560 --> 00:20:39,730
-Here you go. -Thanks.
拿去 謝謝

340
00:20:45,570 --> 00:20:49,570
God,this is silly. I'll see you in a couple of hours.
天哪，多好笑 再過幾小時就會見面了

341
00:20:51,250 --> 00:20:52,580
Bye,house.
房子再見

342
00:20:58,857 --> 00:20:59,983
再見

343
00:21:24,880 --> 00:21:27,470
-She really left. -I know.
她真的走了 我知道

344
00:21:30,380 --> 00:21:33,440
-Thank you. -No problem,roomie.
謝謝你 不客氣，室友

345
00:21:41,530 --> 00:21:43,960
-Can I ask you a question? -Sure.
我可以問你一個問題嗎？ 當然可以

346
00:21:44,200 --> 00:21:46,890
What the hell is that dog doing here?
那隻狗怎麼會在這裡？

347
00:21:50,570 --> 00:21:53,870
I invented the game of Cups as a way to give Joey money.
我捏造了杯牌好塞錢給喬伊

348
00:21:54,110 --> 00:21:57,570
-And now you want that money back? -Exactly.
現在你想把錢要回去 沒錯

349
00:21:57,810 --> 00:22:00,110
What kind of idiot do you take me for?
錢德，你以為我是白癡嗎？

350
00:22:01,380 --> 00:22:03,440
It's not a real game. I made it up.
沒有那種牌，那是我捏造的

351
00:22:03,720 --> 00:22:06,810
I'm sorry you lost your money. But I won it fair and square.
很遺憾你輸錢 但我贏得光明正大

352
00:22:07,050 --> 00:22:08,420
At a fake game!
遊戲是假的

353
